    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14331" root="رأى" body-key="r">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استرآهُ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> or <i>it, called for, demanded, or
required, the seeing of it;</i> (M, K;) i. e., a thing.
(M.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 1, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see 3,
last sentence but one. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُسْتَرْأَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ</span> [<i>Such a one is counted, accounted,</i> or
<i>esteemed, hypocritical,</i> or <i>ostentatious</i>], from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرِّئَآءُ</span>
[inf. n. of 3]; like as you say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُسْتَحْمِقُ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يُسْتَعْقَلُ</span>. (AA, S.)

